      "summary": "Evidence summary: 4 validated structured observations; consult observations and conflicts for supported findings.",
      "observations": [
        {
          "category": "structure",
          "statement": "The game is a dialogue-heavy, combat-free role-playing adventure built around exploration, conversations and skill checks rather than tactical battles; players compare its investigative structure to narrative CRPGs and point-and-click adventures.",
